  {
   "k": "1ip2nuv",
   "en": "Note that even though the description doesn't say so, you actually need to fully control (but not own) all your cores as well after taking the respective focus. This adds a lot of difficulty since it means a war with the Allies and potentially the Soviets (if the PRC joins their faction/Sinkiang fails to unite), or try focus ⟦0⟧ and border wars. Pick ⟦1⟧ on historical and follow the shared tree with Guanxi Clique. Unify with Guanxi clique and don't back down with China. They will declare on you, but it's easy to just hold the line for a year and they will white peace you. Go opposition and don't join the CUF and the war against Japan, but start border wars with China and warlords to eat states off of them over time. When the final focus on the opposition tree is taken you will switch to Nat. China focus tree but you will retain the border wars mechanic. When Japan shares a border with you they will declare on you, don't join any faction and push them back together with the united front. Since you are not in faction and you have cores on all of China, whatever you conquer will be under your control and not China. When Japan is pushed back (it won't white peace because the AI doesn't accept it), declare on the CUF (At this point China should be left with 2/3 states) and capitulate it. At this point, just occupy Hong Kong, Macau and Guangzhouwan and the achievement will fire.",
